## Summary

This PR adds CUTLASS W4A8 MoE support for DeepEP low-latency dispatch.

The existing CUTLASS W4A8 MoE path assumes flat routed-token inputs. DeepEP low-latency dispatch produces padded batched-expert tensors and carries the real routed-row count separately. This PR adds a batched CUTLASS W4A8 experts implementation for that activation format while preserving the existing native ABI.

